    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Clean and validate this student enrollment row and return ONLY a JSON object.\n\nRow data: {{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nRules:\n- **Student_ID:** Trim spaces and preserve the original ID.\n- **Name:** Convert to Title Case (Example: fernandes a → Fernandes A).\n- **Email:**\n  - Trim spaces and convert to lowercase.\n  - Remove accidental spaces within the email address.\n  - Correct obvious spelling mistakes in common email domains (e.g., gmial.com → gmail.com, gmai.com → gmail.com, yahooo.com → yahoo.com, outlok.com → outlook.com).\n  - Fix obvious email formatting issues, such as missing @ when the intended address is unambiguous, or duplicate @ symbols.\n  - Do not guess or modify the username portion of the email.\n  - Validate the corrected email format.\n  - If the email cannot be confidently corrected or remains invalid, set `INVALID_EMAIL`.\n- **Phone:** Remove spaces, hyphens, and special characters. If fewer than 10 digits remain, set `MISSING`. Preserve the phone number as a string.\n- **Course:** Standardize to one of these values only: `Python`, `Machine Learning`, or `Data Science`. Correct obvious spelling mistakes. If the course cannot be identified, set `UNKNOWN`.\n- **Fee_Paid:** Convert yes/YES/true/1 to `true` and no/NO/false/0 to `false`. If unclear, return `null`.\n- **City:** Convert to Title Case. If empty or missing, set `UNKNOWN`.\n- **Enrolled_Date:** Convert valid dates to `YYYY-MM-DD`. If invalid or ambiguous, return `null`.\n\nImportant:\n- Preserve all original JSON field names.\n- Return all 8 student enrollment fields.\n- Do not invent missing information.\n- Return valid JSON data types (Boolean and null without quotes).\n- Return ONLY one raw JSON object.\n- No explanation, no markdown, and no code fences.",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        144,
        -32
      ],
      "id": "ea6d1b2c-f866-4efd-91fb-712296d1fac6",
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain"
    },
